Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 08:17:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] sr-aef: make glyph names unique

A post table may give two glyphs the same name, and the uncompiled features
could not tell them apart. Now a repeated name gets the first free .1, .2, ...
suffix, as fontTools does, and the TTF reader names glyphs as the features do.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
